ttings.\n- \ud83d\ude80 Gorilla Moves: Leap and glide for amazing shots in multiplayer.\n- \ud83e\udd16 Tons of Modes: Choose from basketball, soccer, or handball in 1v1, 2v2, or 3v3, plus cool challenges.\n\nElevate Your Game with Space Pass:\n- \ud83d\ude32 New Courts: Explore awesome new space arenas.\n- \ud83c\udf20 Unique Characters: Switch it up with different characters.\n- \ud83c\udfa8 Exclusive Gear: Grab special skins, helmets, and more.", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfc0\ud83e\udd8d Play basketball in space with the agility of a gorilla \u2013 Space Ball is out of this world VR sports like you've never seen before!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/f878b844-29a5-4c96-9046-204d86949be4", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "31 Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spaceballvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7007455832654651"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974866_1937799163254725_2584358398728931094_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0D-oYp0rFz4Q7kNvwHIsiuB&_nc_oc=Adon1BPzd81JBAaA2CKFadPRkyKglM5P5CWbV4b9enSc0qmR-HajSFj-d_VNtxK7a4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDqT3cFpK85ftgA5cFj